IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssc-core`
IMPORT `ssc1-general`

-- Tests for ssc1-general.l4 (ss 19A to 19B). Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion.

§ `Tests for ss 19A to 19B`

§§ `s 19A`

-- s 19A(1): 1998-99 or a subsequent tax year; (a), (b) and (c) all needed
#ASSERT `s 19A(1) section 19A applies` (`Tax year` OF 1998) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19A(1) section 19A applies` (`Tax year` OF 2020) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19A(1) section 19A applies` (`Tax year` OF 1997) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19A(1) section 19A applies` (`Tax year` OF 1998) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19A(1) section 19A applies` (`Tax year` OF 1998) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19A(1) section 19A applies` (`Tax year` OF 1998) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 19A(1)(c): year 1 = 2020-21, year 2 = 2021-22, which ends on 5 April 2022
#ASSERT `s 19A(1)(c) the last day of year 2` (`Tax year` OF 2020) EQUALS Date 5 4 2022
#ASSERT `s 19A(1)(c) the last day of year 2` (`Tax year` OF 1998) EQUALS Date 5 4 2000
-- s 19A(2): after the end of year 2 (the day itself is not after it), unless prescribed otherwise, for (a) and (b)
#ASSERT `s 19A(2) the earner is treated as if the earnings were derived from employed earner's employment` (JUST TRUE) (Date 5 4 2022) (Date 6 4 2022) FALSE `s 19A(2)(a) contributions and contributory benefits` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19A(2) the earner is treated as if the earnings were derived from employed earner's employment` (JUST TRUE) (Date 5 4 2022) (Date 6 4 2022) FALSE `s 19A(2)(b) statutory sick pay and statutory maternity pay` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19A(2) the earner is treated as if the earnings were derived from employed earner's employment` (JUST TRUE) (Date 5 4 2022) (Date 5 4 2022) FALSE `s 19A(2)(a) contributions and contributory benefits` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19A(2) the earner is treated as if the earnings were derived from employed earner's employment` (JUST TRUE) (Date 5 4 2022) (Date 6 4 2022) TRUE `s 19A(2)(a) contributions and contributory benefits` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 19A(2) the earner is treated as if the earnings were derived from employed earner's employment` (JUST TRUE) (Date 5 4 2022) (Date 6 4 2022) FALSE `s 19A(2) another purpose` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19A(2) the earner is treated as if the earnings were derived from employed earner's employment` NOTHING (Date 5 4 2022) (Date 6 4 2022) FALSE `s 19A(2)(a) contributions and contributory benefits` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 19B`

#ASSERT `s 19B a reference to benefit or contributory benefit in Part I includes the benefit` `s 19B benefit under Part 1 of the Pensions Act 2014` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19B a reference to benefit or contributory benefit in Part I includes the benefit` `s 19B another benefit` EQUALS NOTHING
